2Ch 24:1 , Joash reigns well all the days of Jehoiada;
2Ch 24:4 , He gives order for the repair of the temple;
2Ch 24:15 , Jehoiada's death and honourable burial;
2Ch 24:17 , Joash, falling into idolatry, slays Zechariah the son of Jehoiada;
2Ch 24:23 , Joash is spoiled by the Syrians, and slain by Zabad and Jehozabad;
2Ch 24:27 , Amaziah succeeds him.
